-story/krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16#:~:text=Aurelia%27s%20gonna%20be%20our,the%20right%20to%20rule.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Krenko, Mob Boss\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16-e5","era":null,"summary":"Krenko sets fires and bombs through the floors of Sunhome to create chaos and slips unnoticed into Vinrenn's chambers.","participants":["krenko","feather"],"location":"sunhome","importance":"major","page":"stories/krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16","order":344,"story_date":"2012-07-16","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":32,"quote":"Chaos is the best cover, and Krenko went about setting fires and kicking down doors.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16#:~:text=Chaos%20is%20the%20best,and%20kicking%20down%20doors.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Krenko, Mob Boss","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16#:~:text=Chaos%20is%20the%20best,and%20kicking%20down%20doors.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Krenko, Mob Boss\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16-e6","era":null,"summary":"Krenko finds an angel in stasis inside a detention sphere and smashes it open with the shiv's handle.","participants":["krenko","feather","detention-sphere","taz-s-glowing-shiv"],"location":"sunhome","importance":"major","page":"stories/krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16","order":344,"story_date":"2012-07-16","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":35,"quote":"With another good smash, the sphere dissipated, sending the angel tumbling unceremoniously to the floor.","l